  "scope": "Replace four zero-contradiction arguments with positivity reflection from products in GCD norm normalization",
  "validation": "Paired target and all three tracked direct Lean clients pass, with identical client objects. Four-object-pinned probes show 29 matching target declaration/type/axiom reports and identical default simp and instance censuses. Current-source PellKnownUnit and PellRecurrence input pairs match prior source-built producer receipts.",
  "limitations": [
    "Project, Foundation and Mathlib transitive dependencies remain cached; direct source/object producer associations do not establish a fully source-current closure. The later Pell and construction graph was not rebuilt; matching direct-client objects do not prove downstream replay.",
    "The census compares declarations, types, axioms and the stated registrations; it does not establish equality of proof bodies or all persistent environment extensions.",
    "The one shared-load CPU timing pair is not a general benchmark. Author records predate the commit; the independent review/audit verify commit and parent sources.",
    "Compiled objects and cached overlays are omitted. Recorded paths include temporary /dev/shm objects and require those external objects for independent byte verification."
  ],
